e with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Tumeleta chaguo hili ili usipate kukosa sasisho muhimu na kutusaidia kufanya %s iendane vyema na tovuti yako na iwe bora zaidi katika kufanya kile unachohitaji ifanye.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Tunafurahi kuanzisha ujumuishaji wa kiwango cha mtandao wa Freemius.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'Wakati wa mchakato wa kusasisha, tumetambua tovuti %s kwenye mtandao ambazo bado zinahitaji umakini wako.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'Wakati wa mchakato wa kusasisha, tumetambua tovuti %d ambazo bado zinangoja kuwezeshwa kwa leseni.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Ikiwa ungependa kutumia %s kwenye tovuti hizo, tafadhali weka ufunguo wako wa leseni hapa chini na ubofye kitufe cha kuwezesha.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'Vinginevyo, unaweza kuiruka kwa sasa na kuwezesha leseni baadaye, katika ukurasa wa Akaunti ya kiwango cha mtandao wa %s wako.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Imeunganishwa','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Ukimaliza, zima %s kisha uiwashe tena.','Contact'=>'Wasiliana Nasi','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Tafadhali tujulishe iwapo ungependa tukupigie simu au kukutumia ujumbe kwa ajili ya masasisho ya usalama na vipengele, maudhui ya kielimu, na matoleo ya mara kwa mara:','Contact Support'=>'Wasiliana na Usaidizi','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Tunaomba radhi kwa usumbufu na tuko hapa kukusaidia ukitupa nafasi.','Contact Us'=>'Wasiliana Nasi','Please con