ial offers.'=>'Kushiriki jina na barua pepe yako kunatuwezesha kukutaarifu kuhusu vipengele vipya na masasisho muhimu, kukuonya kuhusu masuala ya usalama kabla hayajajulikana kwa umma, na kukutumia matoleo maalum.','Diagnostic data will no longer be sent from %1$s to %2$s.'=>'Data ya uchunguzi haitatumwa tena kutoka %1$s kwenda %2$s.','Opt in to make "%s" better!'=>'Jiandikishe ili kufanya "%s" iwe bora zaidi!','Opting in'=>'Kujiandikisha','Opting out'=>'Kujiondoa','For ongoing compatibility with your website, you can optionally allow %s to:'=>'Kwa ajili ya upatanifu unaoendelea na tovuti yako, unaweza hiari kuruhusu %s:','Other'=>'Nyingine','Plugin installer section titleOther Notes'=>'Vidokezo Vingine','Owner Email'=>'Barua pepe ya Mmiliki','Owner ID'=>'Kitambulisho cha Mmiliki','Owner Name'=>'Jina la Mmiliki','Paid add-on must be deployed to Freemius.'=>'Add-on ya kulipwa lazima ipelekwe kwenye Freemius.','as file/folder pathPath'=>'Njia','Payments'=>'Malipo','Payouts are in USD and processed monthly via PayPal.'=>'Malipo ya mtandaoni yapo katika USD na huchakatwa kila mwezi kupitia PayPal.','PayPal account email address'=>'Anwani ya barua pepe ya akaunti ya PayPal','PayPal email address is required.'=>'Anwani ya barua pepe ya PayPal inahitajika.','PCI compliant'=>'Inayotii kanuni za PCI','View Diagnostic Info'=>'Tazama Taarifa za Utambuzi','WordPress & PHP versions, site language & title'=>'Toleo la WordPress na PHP, lugha na kichwa cha tovuti','To avoid breaking your website due to WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Ili kuepuka kuvunja tovuti yako kwa sababu ya kutopatana kwa matoleo ya WordPress au PHP, na kutambua lugha na maeneo ambayo %s inapaswa kutafsiriwa na kurekebishwa.','View License Essentials'=>'Tazama Mambo Muhimu ya Leseni','Homepage URL, %s version, SDK version'=>'URL ya Ukurasa wa Nyumbani, toleo la %s, toleo la SDK','To let you manage & control wh