bsite, %1$s, as a temporary duplicate of %2$s.'=>'Umeiweka tovouti hii, %1$s, kama nakala ya muda ya %2$s.','You marked this website, %s, as a temporary duplicate of these sites'=>'Ulitiaweka tovuti hii, %s, kama nakala ya muda ya tovuti hizi','Thank you!'=>'Asante!','Thank you so much for using %s!'=>'Asante sana kwa kutumia %s!','Thank you so much for using %s and its add-ons!'=>'Asante sana kwa kutumia %s na viongezi vyake!','Thank you so much for using our products!'=>'Asante sana kwa kutumia bidhaa zetu!','Thanks!'=>'Asante!','Welcome to %s! To get started, please enter your license key:'=>'Karibu kwenye %s! Ili uanze, tafadhali weka ufunguo wao wa leseni:','Thanks, please wait'=>'Asante, tafadhali subiri','Thanks %s!'=>'Asante %s!','The following products\''=>'Bidhaa zifuatazo\'','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.the installation instructions'=>'maagizo ya ufungaji','"The <product_label>", e.g.: "The plugin"The %s\'s'=>'Ya %s','Theme'=>'Mandhari','Theme Switch'=>'Badilisha Mandhari','Themes'=>'Mandhari','Themes page'=>'Ukurasa wa Mandhari','This will allow %s to'=>'Hii itaruhusu %s kuwezesha','Timestamp'=>'Muhuri wa Wakati','Title'=>'Kichwa cha habari','Terms of Service'=>'Masharti ya Huduma','Total'=>'Jumla','Town'=>'Mji','Seems like we are having some temporary issue with your trial cancellation. Please try again in few minutes.'=>'Inaonekana kuna tatizo la muda kidogo katika kughairi jaribio lako. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','Your %s free trial was successfully cancelled.'=>'Jaribio lako la bure la %s limeghairiwa kwa mafanikio.','It looks like you are not in trial mode anymore so there\'s nothing to cancel :)'=>'Inaonekana huko tena katika hali ya majaribio kwa hivyo hakuna cha kusitisha :)','Your free trial has expired. You can still continue using all our free features.'=>'Jaribio lako la bure limekwisha. Bado unaweza kuendelea kutumia vipengele vyetu vyote vya bure.','Your free trial has expire