'Siku','Hours'=>'Masaa','Minutes'=>'Dakika','Seconds'=>'Sekunde','Go to slide %d'=>'Nenda kwenye slaidi %d','You\'re already subscribed to our newsletter'=>'Tayari umesajiliwa kupokea jarida letu','Email address is already subscribed.'=>'Anwani ya barua pepe tayari imesajiliwa.','MailPoet plugin not found. Please contact the admin.'=>'Program-in-soma ya MailPoet haipatikani. Tafadhali wasiliana na msimamizi.','We are doing some maintenance on this site. Please check back soon.'=>'Tunafanya matengenezo kwenye tovuti hii. Tafadhali rudi tena hivi karibuni.','This site is launching soon.'=>'Tovuti hii itazinduliwa hivi karibuni.','Maintenance mode is on'=>'Hali ya matengenezo imewashwa','Pre-launch mode is on'=>'Hali ya kabla ya uzinduzi imewashwa','Network templates'=>'Violeti za mtandao','That find-and-replace job no longer exists.'=>'Kazi hiyo ya kutafuta na kubadilisha haipo tena.','That step is not available for this job right now.'=>'Hatua hiyo haipatikani kwa kazi hii kwa sasa.','Enter what to find.'=>'Weka kile cha kutafuta.','Colours must be hex codes such as #1a73e8 or #fff.'=>'Rangi lazima ziwe misimbo ya heksi kama vile #1a73e8 au #fff.','The new link must be a full web address (https://…), a path starting with /, or an anchor starting with #.'=>'Kiungo kipya lazima kiwe anwani kamili ya wavuti (https://...), njia inayoanzia na /, au nanga inayoanzia na #.','Client review comments'=>'Maoni ya ukaguzi wa mteja','Write a comment first.'=>'Andika maoni kwanza.','Client'=>'Mteja','That comment no longer exists.'=>'Maoni hayo hayapo tena.','New review comment on “%s”'=>'Maoni mapya ya ukaguzi kwenye "%s"','%1$s wrote:

%2$s

Open the page in the editor to answer or resolve it:
%3$s'=>'%1$s aliandika:

%2$s

Fungua ukurasa kwenye kihariri ili kujibu au kulitatua:
%3$s','This review link is not valid any more. Ask for a new one.'=>'Kiungo hiki cha uhakiki hakitumiki tena. Omba kipya.','Too many comments from this link in the last hour. Try again later.'=>'Maoni mengi sana kutoka kwa kiungo hiki katika saa iliyopita. Jaribu tena baadaye.','Your role cannot create templates or patterns.'=>'Wajibu wako hauwezi kuunda violezo au miundo.','You can change the text and images on this page, but not its layout or design. Your change was not saved.'=>'Unaweza kubadilisha maandishi na picha kwenye ukurasa huu, lakini sio muundo au mpangilio wake. Mabadiliko yako hayakuhifadhiwa.','Your role cannot change styles. Undo the style changes and save again.'=>'Jukumu lako haliwezi kubadilisha mitindo. Tendua mabadiliko ya mtindo na uhifadhi tena.','Your role cannot add or change custom code (custom CSS or HTML blocks). Undo those changes and save again.'=>'Jukumu thepe haliongezi au kubadilisha msimbo maalum (vizuizi maalum vya CSS au HTML). Tendua mabadiliko hayo na uhifadhi tena.','This is not an export file from this plugin.'=>'Hii si faili ya kuhamisha kutoka kwa programu-jalizi hii.','This export file was made by a newer version of the plugin. Update the plugin on this site, then import it again.'=>'Faili hili la kusafirisha nje limetengenezwa na toleo jipya zaidi la programu jalizi. Sasisha programu jalizi kwenye tovuti hii, kisha uingize tena.','The export file is damaged: its list of items is missing.'=>'Faili ya kuhamisha imeharibika: orodha yake ya vipengee haipo.','The export file is damaged or was edited after it was made (its checksum does not match). Export it again from the other site.'=>'Faili la kuhamisha limeharibika au limehaririwa baada ya kuundwa (kazi yake ya kukagua hailingani). Kihamishe tena kutoka kwenye tovuti nyingine.','“%s” was not imported: this site does not have that kind of item.'=>'"%s" haikuingizwa: tovuti hii haina aina hiyo ya kipengee.','“%s” was not imported: you are not allowed to create that kind of item.'=>'“%s” haikusafirishwa: huruhusiwi kuunda aina hiyo ya bidhaa.','“%s” was not replaced: you are not allowed to edit the one on this site.'=>'“%s” haikubadilishwa: huruhusiwi kuhariri ile iliyo kwenye tovuti hii.','“%1$s” was not imported: %2$s'=>'“%1$s” haijasafishwa kutoka nje: %2$s','Settings were not imported: only an administrator can change them.'=>'Mipangilio haikuletwa: msimamizi pekee ndiye anayeweza kuibadilisha.','The image %1$s was not copied: %2$s'=>'Picha %1$s haikunakiliwa: %2$s','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Imetengenezwa na Neil Lock, Mkurugenzi Mtendaji wa Zinn Digital® Ltd','Version %s'=>'Toleo la %s','Page Builder Sandwich website'=>'Tovuti ya Page Builder Sandwich','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Tovuti ya Zinn Digital®','Settings saved.'=>'Mipangilio imehifadhiwa.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Tazama mipango ya Pro na bei','Front-end output'=>'Matokeo ya mbele','Class name prefix'=>'Kiambishi awali cha jina la darasa','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Kila jina la darasa ambalo programu-jalizi huchapisha kwenye kurasa zako linaanza na kiambishi hiki, ili kurasa zisifunue ni programu-jalizi ipi iliyozijenga. Herufi ndogo 1 hadi 8 au tarakimu, zinazoanza na herufi moja.','Save'=>'Hifadhi','Beta updates'=>'Sasisho za Beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Tovuti hii hupokea matoleo ya beta kama sasisho.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Tovuti hii inapokea matoleo thabiti pekee.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Badilisha hii kwenye ukurasa wa Akaunti','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Matoleo ya Beta hutolewa kwa usakinishaji wa Pro wenye leseni ambao umeunganishwa na akaunti yao. Mara baada ya kuunganishwa, unaweza kujiunga kupitia ukurasa wa Akaunti.','The request converting this post stopped before it finished, so the post was skipped. Open it to convert it, or convert it again from here.'=>'Ombi la kubadilisha chapisho hili lilisimama kabla halijakamilika, kwa hiyo chapisho lilirukwa. Lifungue ili ulibadilishe, au ulibadilishe tena kutoka hapa.','There is no backup of this post to restore.'=>'Hakuna nakala rudufu ya chapisho hili ya kurejesha.','The converted content could not be saved.'=>'Maudhui yaliyobadilishwa hayakuweza kuhifadhiwa.','Unknown error.'=>'Hitilafu isiyojulikana.','No legacy content has been checked yet.'=>'Hakuna maudhui ya zamani yaliyochunguzwa bado.','Restoring legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Inarejesha maudhui ya zamani: machapisho %1$d kati ya %2$d.','Converting legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Inabadilisha maudhui ya zamani: machapisho %1$d kati ya %2$d.','Undo finished: %1$d restored, %2$d failed.'=>'Tendua imekamilisha: %1$d zimerejeshwa, %2$d zimeshindwa.','Conversion finished: %1$d converted, %2$d unchanged, %3$d failed.'=>'Ubadilishaji umekamilika: %1$d imebadilishwa, %2$d haijabadilishwa, %3$d imeshindwa.','Legacy content'=>'Maudhui ya zamani','Pages made with earlier versions of Page Builder Sandwich are converted to blocks in the background. Every post is backed up first, so each conversion can be undone.'=>'Kurasa zilizoundwa kwa matoleo ya awali ya Page Builder Sandwich zinabadilishwa kuwa vizuizi kwa nyuma. Kila chapisho hifadhi rudufu yake inatengenezwa kwanza, kwa hivyo kila mabadiliko yanaweza kutenduliwa.','%d post still holds legacy content.'=>'Chapisho %d bado lina maudhui ya zamani.' . "\0" . 'Machapisho %d bado yana maudhui ya zamani.','%d post has a backup.'=>'Machapisho %d yana nakala rudufu.' . "\0" . 'Machapisho %d yana nakala rudufu.','%d post could not be handled'=>'Chapisho %d halikuweza kushughulikiwa' . "\0" . 'Machapisho %d hayakuweza kushughulikiwa','Post %d'=>'Chapisho %d','Conversion started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Ubadilishaji umeanza. Unaendelea chinichini; unaweza kuacha ukurasa huu.','Convert legacy content'=>'Badili maudhui ya zamani','Restore every converted post to its legacy content? Changes made to those posts since they were converted will be lost.'=>'Rejesha kila chapisho lililobadilishwa kuwa maudhui yake ya awali? Mabadiliko yaliyofanywa kwa machapisho hayo tangu yalipobadilishwa yatapotea.','Undo started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Tendeni limeanza. Linaendelea chinichini; unaweza kuacha ukurasa huu.','Undo all conversions'=>'Tendua mabadiliko yote','Shortcode tag'=>'Lebo ya msimbo mfupi','Use letters, numbers, dashes and underscores only.'=>'Tumia herufi, namba, vistari na mistari ya chini pekee.','Attribute name'=>'Jina la sifa','Add attribute'=>'Ongeza sifa','Content'=>'Maudhui','Shortcode'=>'Nambari fupi','Choose a shortcode tag in the block settings.'=>'Chagua lebo ya msimbo mfupi katika mipangilio ya kizuizi.','The "%s" control from the old editor is not available in the block editor. Enter the value as text.'=>'Udhibiti wa "%s" kutoka kwa kihariri cha zamani haupatikani katika kihariri cha vizuizi. Weka thamani kama maandishi.','Choose image'=>'Chagua picha','Choose file'=>'Chagua faili','— Default —'=>'— Chaguomsingi —','Advanced styling'=>'Mtindo wa kina','Inline CSS'=>'CSS ya Ndani','CSS declarations, for example: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333'=>'Matamshi ya CSS, kwa mfano: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333','Effects (legacy classes)'=>'Madhara (madarasa ya urithi)','Space-separated effect names carried over from older versions, for example: hover-shadow'=>'Majina ya athari yaliyotenganishwa na nafasi tupu yaliyohamishwa kutoka matoleo ya zamani, kwa mfano: hover-shadow','Row'=>'Safu','Width'=>'Upana','Content width'=>'Upana wa maudhui','Full width'=>'Upana kamili','Full width, content kept in the middle'=>'Upana wote, maudhui yamewekwa katikati','Link'=>'Unganisha'