e','Rename the builder and hide our branding on this site'=>'Badilisha jina la kijenzi na ufiche chapa yetu kwenye tovuti hii','Shown everywhere the product name appears: menus, the editor, notices.'=>'Inaonyeshwa kila mahali jina la bidhaa linapoonekana: kwenye menyu, kihariri, na arifa.','Leave empty to use the builder name.'=>'Acha wazi ili kutumia jina la kiunda tovuti.','Description on the Plugins screen'=>'Maelezo kwenye skrini ya Programu-jalizi','A Dashicons name (for example dashicons-admin-customizer) or an https:// image address.'=>'Jina la Dashicons (kwa mfano dashicons-admin-customizer) au anwani ya picha ya https://.','Hide the plugin from the Plugins screen'=>'Ficha programu-jalizi kutoka kwenye skrini ya Programu-jalizi','Agency users who still see the real product and these settings'=>'Watumiaji wa shirika ambao bado wanaona bidhaa halisi na mipangilio hii','%d new'=>'%d mpya' . "\0" . '%d mpya','%d replaced'=>'%d zimebadilishwa' . "\0" . '%d zimebadilishwa','%d kept as they were'=>'%d zilihifadhiwa zilivyokuwa' . "\0" . '%d zilihifadhiwa zilivyokuwa','%d setting'=>'mpangilio %d' . "\0" . 'mipangilio %d','Importing will give: %s.'=>'Kuingiza kutatoa: %s.','Imported: %s.'=>'Imetumizwa kutoka: %s.','Exported %d item.'=>'Kilichosafirishwa ni kipengee %d.' . "\0" . 'Vipengele %d vimesafirishwa.','That file could not be read as an export file.'=>'Faili hiyo haikuweza kusomwa kama faili la kutoa nje.','Import and export'=>'Ingiza na upeleke nje','Export'=>'Hamisha','Download your templates, patterns and site design as one file, to import on another site.'=>'Pakua violezo vyako, mifumo na muundo wa tovuti kama faili moja, ili kuleta kwenye tovuti nyingine.','There are no templates or patterns to export yet.'=>'Hakuna templeti au ruwaza za kuhamisha bado.','Include the settings'=>'Jumuisha mipangilio','Download the export file'=>'Pakua faili la usafirishaji','Import'=>'Ingiza','Choose an export file'=>'Chagua faili ya kuuza nje','The file holds %1$d item fr