 is cleaned before it is shown.'=>'Ikoni ya SVG. Alama zake husafishwa kabla ya kuonyeshwa.','block keywordicon'=>'aikoni','block keywordsvg'=>'svg','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Kibadilishaji lugha','block descriptionLets visitors read this page in another language, styled to match your page. Needs the Tranzly plugin for the languages.'=>'Inaruhusu wageni kusoma ukurasa huu kwa lugha nyingine, ukiwa umeundwa ili uendane na ukurasa wako. Inahitaji programu jalizi ya Tranzly kwa ajili ya lugha hizo.','block keywordtranslation'=>'tafsiri','block keywordmultilingual'=>'yenye lugha nyingi','block titleRow'=>'Safu','block descriptionA row of columns. Stays readable if the plugin is ever turned off.'=>'Safu ya safu wima. Inaendelea kusomeka ikiwa programu-jalizi itazimwa wakati wowote.','block keywordrow'=>'safu','block keywordcolumns'=>'Safu','block titleShortcode (add-on)'=>'Nambari fupi (jalizo)','block descriptionA shortcode from an add-on written for the classic Page Builder Sandwich editor, with the settings the add-on declared.'=>'Shortcode kutoka kwa kiongezi kilichoandikwa kwa ajili ya kihariri cha kitamaduni cha Page Builder Sandwich, chenye mipangilio ambayo kiongezi hicho kilitangaza.','block keywordshortcode'=>'kodi fupi','block keywordadd-on'=>'nyongeza','block titleWidget area'=>'Eneo la wijeti','block descriptionShows the widgets in one of the theme\'s widget areas.'=>'Inaonyesha wijeti katika moja ya maeneo ya wijeti ya mada.','block keywordsidebar'=>'mwamba wa pembeni','block keywordwidget area'=>'eneo la wijeti','block titleWidget'=>'Wijeti','block descriptionShows one of the site\'s registered classic widgets.'=>'Inaonyesha mojawapo ya wijeti za asili zilizosajiliwa za tovuti.','block keywordwidget'=>'wijeti']];